      "side": 1,
      "message": "This happens only when EC enables PD in RO then jumps to RW, right? I think we can eliminate this path. That is, we will deal with only the two cases:\n\n1. PD in RO. Stay in RO until next hard reset.\n2. No PD in RO. Jump to RW.\n\n(And I assume jump-to-RO is an option only for developers.)\n\nThis is basically how I\u0027m suggesting we deal with https://b.corp.google.com/issues/168169691, too.",
